    {
      "source": "Return the list of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/ObjectName.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>ObjectName</code></a> String representations for\nwhich the encapsulated <a href=\"#getNotificationFilter()\"><code>NotificationFilter</code></a> will\nbe registered as a listener for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回封装的<a href=\"#getNotificationFilter()\"><code>NotificationFilter</code></a>将作为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>的监听器注册的<code>ObjectName</code>字符串表示形式的列表。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/ObjectName.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>ObjectName</code></a>-style name of the single MBean\nthat the encapsulated <a href=\"#getNotificationFilter()\"><code>NotificationFilter</code></a>\nwill be registered with to listen for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>.\nCan be specified as <code>ObjectName</code> instance or as <code>String</code>.",
      "translation": "设置封装的 `<a href=\"#getNotificationFilter()\"><code>NotificationFilter</code></a>` 将注册以监听 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>` 的单个 MBean 的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/ObjectName.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>ObjectName</code></a>` 风格名称。可以指定为 `<code>ObjectName</code>` 实例或 `<code>String</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set an array of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/ObjectName.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>ObjectName</code></a>-style names of the MBeans\nthat the encapsulated <a href=\"#getNotificationFilter()\"><code>NotificationFilter</code></a>\nwill be registered with to listen for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>.\nCan be specified as <code>ObjectName</code> instances or as <code>String</code>s.",
      "translation": "设置一个数组，包含封装的 `<a href=\"#getNotificationFilter()\"><code>NotificationFilter</code></a>` 将注册以监听 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>` 的 MBean 的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/ObjectName.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>ObjectName</code></a>` 风格名称。可以指定为 `<code>ObjectName</code>` 实例或 `<code>String</code>`。",
      "count": 2
