    {
      "source": "Return the (arbitrary) object that will be 'handed back' as-is by an\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationBroadcaster.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationBroadcaster</code></a> when notifying\nany <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListener</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回（任意）对象，该对象将由 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationBroadcaster.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationBroadcaster</code></a>` 在通知任何 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListener</code></a>` 时原样“交回”。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationFilter.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationFilter</code></a> associated\nwith the encapsulated <a href=\"#getNotificationListener()\"><code>NotificationListener</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回与封装的<a href=\"#getNotificationListener()\"><code>NotificationListener</code></a>关联的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationFilter.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationFilter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the (arbitrary) object that will be 'handed back' as-is by an\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationBroadcaster.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationBroadcaster</code></a> when notifying\nany <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListener</code></a>.",
      "translation": "设置一个（任意的）对象，当通知任何 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListener</code></a> 时，该对象将由 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationBroadcaster.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationBroadcaster</code></a> 原样“交回”。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
