    {
      "source": "Helper class that aggregates a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListener</code></a>,\na <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationFilter.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationFilter</code></a>, and an arbitrary handback\nobject, as well as the names of MBeans from which the listener wishes\nto receive <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>.",
      "translation": "辅助类，用于聚合 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationListener</code></a>`、`<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/NotificationFilter.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>NotificationFilter</code></a>` 以及任意回传对象，同时包含监听器希望从中接收 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.management/javax/management/Notification.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.management\"><code>Notifications</code></a>` 的 MBean 名称。",
